          "message": {
            "text": "The default gate is pinned immediately above the first measured maxima, not an arbitrary tolerance. The live 128-case run measured 0.551 CSS px worst edge error and 0.471 worst alpha-profile RMSE; it also selected CSS outer-edge rounding with 0.000 CSS px center MAE. This makes regressions fail now while giving later paint work explicit numbers to reduce and tighten.",
            "markdown": "The default gate is pinned immediately above the first measured maxima, not an arbitrary tolerance. The live 128-case run measured 0.551 CSS px worst edge error and 0.471 worst alpha-profile RMSE; it also selected CSS outer-edge rounding with 0.000 CSS px center MAE. This makes regressions fail now while giving later paint work explicit numbers to reduce and tighten."
          },
